---
import { seats } from "../content";
---
<section id="room">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid head">
      <h2 class="h2 c-l6">Everyone works in one room on Switch</h2>
      <p class="lead c-r">Switch turns the family's Telegram group into a room. People, AI agents and three small services all post there, and Switch delivers each message to whoever it's addressed to.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="map after-head" data-room>
      <div class="hub" data-hub><b class="h4">The family room</b><span class="meta">a Telegram group, on Switch</span></div>
      {seats.map((s) => (
        <div class="seat" data-seat data-flow={s.flow} style={`--x:${s.x}%;--y:${s.y}%`}>
          <b class="h4">{s.name}</b>
          <span class="meta">{s.kind}</span>
          <p class="small soft">{s.what}</p>
          <code>{s.call}</code>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="grid after-block" data-stagger>
      <p class="c-l soft"><b class="ink">Rules decide, AI judges.</b> Whether to wake the family about money is a rule, so it is plain, tested code. Reading a ride screenshot is a judgement, so it goes to an AI, and only after an alarm fires.</p>
      <p class="c-r soft measure"><b class="ink">Agents hand off through the room.</b> Bank watch and Line raise an alarm by mentioning the Guardian. The Guardian hands the case to the Clerk the same way, and the Clerk keeps the case file as a Switch room document.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ink { color: var(--ink); }
  .map { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1240 / 860; }
  .hub {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 2;
    width: 15rem; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper);
    display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; gap: 4px; padding: 24px;
  }
  .hub b { font-size: 1.75rem; font-stretch: 75%; }
  .seat {
    position: absolute; left: var(--x); top: var(--y); transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 1;
    width: 14.5rem; padding: 10px 12px; background: var(--paper); display: grid; gap: 2px;
  }
  .seat p { margin-top: 6px; }
  .seat code { margin-top: 6px; font-size: var(--fs-meta); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .map :global(.link) { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; height: 1px; transform-origin: 0 50%; z-index: 0; }
  .map :global(.link i) { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--rule-strong); transform-origin: left; }
  .map :global(.link b) { position: absolute; top: -2.5px; left: 0; width: 6px; height: 6px; margin-left: -3px; background: var(--ink); opacity: 0; }
  .map :global(.link b.in) { background: var(--stamp); }
  @media (max-width: 1060px) {
    .map { aspect-ratio: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: var(--gap); }
    .hub, .seat { position: static; transform: none; width: auto; }
    .hub { grid-column: 1 / -1; aspect-ratio: auto; border-radius: 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); text-align: left; place-content: start; padding: 18px 0; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .seat { padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .map :global(.link) { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .map { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
